SUMMARY:Deadline: CFA Institute x IMGN Grant 2026
DESCRIPTION:One-off film grant awarding a single filmmaker $4\,500 to suppo
 rt an independent narrative project in 2026. Application is free to submit
 . Centerpiece of the application is a production book built on the IMGN pl
 atform: script breakdown\, schedule\, coverage\, and pre-visualization for
  the project (tutorials are provided inside the application).\n\nOrganisat
 ion: CFA Institute (in partnership with IMGN)\nLocation: United States (50
  states + DC\; applicants must be 18+)\nAward: $4\,500 to one filmmaker. I
 f the project is already completed before funds are disbursed\, the $4\,50
 0 is paid as a reimbursement upon submission of a final cut.\nDuration: Pe
 r project\; winner announced and funds disbursed by end of January 2027\n\
 nMore: https://form.jotform.com/CFA_Institute/cfa--imgn-grant-application?
 utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://form.jotform.com/CFA_Institute/cfa--imgn-grant-application?utm_
 source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:United States (50 states + DC\; applicants must be 18+)
