 ios\nLocation: Santa Fe\, New Mexico\, USA. Festival 11-20 June 2027. Open
  to established and emerging new media artists from the USA and around the
  world.\nAward: NO GUARANTEED CASH\, listed as a deliberate exception to t
 he desk's paid-only rule: selected artists may be eligible for travel\, lo
 dging and shipping support\, decided case by case\, and the festival may b
 e able to supply needed equipment. International shipping support is expli
 citly uncertain due to cost. SUBMISSION FEE: USD 30 for a single work\, US
 D 25 each for multiple works.\n\nMore: https://currentsnewmedia.org/festiv
 als/currents-2027-art-technology-festival/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugra
